body:
@Grewer - the process of filing issues and working together with the community means that the bug is being fixed. Thanks to your contribution (and support in debugging) we can now consider how best to fix it. Please remember, Tauri is still alpha, so bugs are literally everywhere.

@lucasfernog - I think we need to add a configure hook in `tauri.conf.json` here for our bootstrapper. It should really be optional (only if they need to get access to the `$PATH`). That will resolve this particular issue. What do you think?

